T132	Quotation 15269 15611	"Hum! Born in New Jersey in the year 1858. Contralto-- hum! La Scala, hum! Prima donna Imperial Opera of Warsaw-- yes! Retired from operatic stage-- ha! Living in London-- quite so! Your Majesty, as I understand, became entangled with this young person, wrote her some compromising letters, and is now desirous of getting those letters back."
